  "truncated_body_text": "A gentleman recently messaged me, asking: “Timothy, should I go back to school and study economics or Finance to do better in the markets?!” Chuckling to myself, I responded confidently with a hard “NO” but that if he truly enjoyed the topics, then go for it.",
